sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Role session / Harness
    participant B as HITL Broker
    participant S as Session / DB
    participant U as Reply surface
    participant D as Device
    A->>B: ask_user with original call identity
    B->>S: Persist question, dialogue, owner version
    B->>B: Enter waiting_for_input; yield worker
    B->>U: Push question or provide Console entry
    U->>B: Acknowledge display, not consent
    U->>B: Explicit reply with response_id
    B->>S: Check question, version and idempotency
    S-->>B: Unique accepted answer
    B-->>A: Continue the original tool call
    A->>D: Refresh before further GUI actions
    D-->>A: Fresh observation; same budget/deadline
